    cell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    description: This chamber contains a gargoyle that appears to be a stone statue.
      The gargoyle does not move at first and only comes to life after one of the
      heroes opens the door that leads into the next room. The gargoyle cannot be
      harmed (takes no damage) until it has either moved or attacked a hero.
    requiresDeadGroup: 
    firstHeroOnly: 1
    trapped: 0
    effects: []
    onTrapSprung: []
    onTrapDisarmed: []
  - key: C
    trigger: 1
    roomId: 
    cell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    description: "The chest is filled with poisonous gas\u2014it is a trap! If a
      hero searches for treasure before the trap is disarmed, they lose 2 Body Points.
      The chest also contains 144 gold coins. There is no other treasure in this
      room."
    requiresDeadGroup: 
    firstHeroOnly: 1
